I8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","review_id":"mWRQ8PAJZnj5J3UxWP6Q9Q","date":"2013-10-14T22:09:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9483758807182312,"text_excerpt":"I didn't like pralines until I went here. I had found them to be dry and crunchy. The ones at Southern Candymakers are creamy and heavenly. My favorites (and yes, I have tried them all) are the chocolate and the regular creamy). I went back twice on this trip - they are that good. Staff is friendly and suggesting you try things, and overall just a fun time."},{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","review_id":"vT6eVCaRQUrT31BlWQcdVg","date":"2015-12-31T06:22:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9458685517311096,"text_excerpt":"When I visit NOLA Southern Candymaker's is a part of the itinerary. The customer service is exceptional. The employees handle a large or small crowd with ease and professionalism. I literally turn into a kid in a candy store. Melt in your mouth goodness and perfection is the best way to describe their pralines. They offer original, and even rum and chocolate. I've tasted and loved all. Trust me I have tried a lot of pralines. From Savannah to New Orleans these are the best! If you're not into pralines try some of their toffee, tortues, dipped oreos, and fudge just to name a few. The candy definitely travels well when stashed in your carry on lol."},{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","review_id":"P0_m0D5lMqO8kYJduINfNA","date":"2016-09-13T22:30:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944082498550415,"text_excerpt":"My go-to pralines are the ones at Southern Candymakers...they're melt-in-your-mouth delicious! Their version is made by mixing sugar, butter, cream, and pecans. I love that they use pecan halves instead of chopped pieces; the nuts get entombed in the sugary goodness like flies in prehistoric amber. In my book their candy is as good as homemade since they don't use preservatives. When you visit you may see them cooking up a batch of candy in-store and turning it out on a marble slab to cool. It doesn't get fresher than that. The original pralines are my favorite but they also make chocolate, coconut, sweet potato, rum and peanut butter flavors. They even have nut-free pralines for people w..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","photo_id":"x3UkFjHBuIkD2-F_lc-B3g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/x3UkFjHBuIkD2-F_lc-B3g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9366074800491333},{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","photo_id":"oo06M1UKzl0JdstEixr4qA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oo06M1UKzl0JdstEixr4qA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8341459035873413},{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","photo_id":"X8QlyHqRY_S_9YK5XHB4jA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/X8QlyHqRY_S_9YK5XHB4jA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8131471872329712},{"business_id":"gOtY7zJ1rIu6UIHXEvh5sA","photo_id":"mbDtwHvB2ErknKvw0l0rdw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mbDtwHvB2ErknKvw0l0rdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7893040180206299}]},"notebook_case":null}
